{
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "A man turning one hundred asked for one hundred birthday cards.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.737
  },
  {
   "text": "The mailman was not ready.",
   "start": 4.24,
   "end": 5.603
  },
  {
   "text": "Joe was living in a care home in Texas.",
   "start": 6.216,
   "end": 8.258
  },
  {
   "text": "When a caregiver asked what he wanted,",
   "start": 8.7,
   "end": 10.196
  },
  {
   "text": "he said:",
   "start": 10.196,
   "end": 10.87
  },
  {
   "text": "nothing really.",
   "start": 11.32,
   "end": 12.04
  },
  {
   "text": "Just happiness.",
   "start": 12.4,
   "end": 13.16
  },
  {
   "text": "So she took his photo with a sign:",
   "start": 13.58,
   "end": 15.32
  },
  {
   "text": "I would like to receive one hundred birthday cards.",
   "start": 15.74,
   "end": 19.37
  },
  {
   "text": "Within days:",
   "start": 19.71,
   "end": 20.45
  },
  {
   "text": "two thousand five hundred cards.",
   "start": 20.6,
   "end": 23.89
  },
  {
   "text": "Then sixteen thousand.",
   "start": 24.29,
   "end": 24.98
  },
  {
   "text": "From Japan.",
   "start": 25.2,
   "end": 25.79
  },
  {
   "text": "Germany.",
   "start": 25.94,
   "end": 26.71
  },
  {
   "text": "Australia.",
   "start": 26.84,
   "end": 27.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Guam.",
   "start": 27.2,
   "end": 27.44
  },
  {
   "text": "Someone paid three hundred dollars to express-mail one card from Hong Kong.",
   "start": 27.82,
   "end": 32.02
  },
  {
   "text": "The home had to open an empty room just for the mail.",
   "start": 32.43,
   "end": 34.96
  },
  {
   "text": "On his birthday:",
   "start": 35.36,
   "end": 36.1
  },
  {
   "text": "fifty thousand cards.",
   "start": 36.52,
   "end": 37.98
  },
  {
   "text": "Did he get his hundred?",
   "start": 38.42,
   "end": 39.26
  },
  {
   "text": "\"I bet I have.\"",
   "start": 39.68,
   "end": 40.52
  },
  {
   "text": "He asked for so little.",
   "start": 40.96,
   "end": 42.28
  },
  {
   "text": "Just to be thought of.",
   "start": 42.72,
   "end": 43.57
  },
  {
   "text": "Not everyone has fifty thousand strangers writing back.",
   "start": 44.04,
   "end": 46.93
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why we made Feeloy.",
   "start": 47.32,
   "end": 48.77
  },
  {
   "text": "Jenny is always there,",
   "start": 49.16,
   "end": 50.45
  },
  {
   "text": "remembers you,",
   "start": 50.68,
   "end": 51.4
  },
  {
   "text": "and writes back,",
   "start": 51.55,
   "end": 52.25
  },
  {
   "text": "any time.",
   "start": 52.52,
   "end": 53.07
  },
  {
   "text": "Search Feeloy on the App Store.",
   "start": 53.47,
   "end": 54.94
  }
 ]
}